            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Stayed put through a wedding",
            "quote": "<p>Ceremony, photos, four hours of dancing. I did not adjust it once. I have never said that about a strapless bra.</p>",
            "author": "Priya S., Toronto",
            "verified": false
          }
        },
        "t2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Finally, off-the-shoulder",
            "quote": "<p>I bought an off-the-shoulder top two summers ago and never wore it. Wore it three times the first week I had this bra.</p>",
            "author": "Camille D., Montreal",
            "verified": false
          }
        },
        "t3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Listen to the size-up advice",
            "quote": "<p>I almost ordered my usual 34C. The page said size up, so I went 36C and it fits exactly right. The band is firm without pinching.</p>",
            "author": "Hannah W., Calgary",
            "verified": false
          }
        }
